//MAGE ROBE OF COLD RESISTANCE - valore 800mo//
COPY "rick_bigg_mod/items/CLCK09.itm" "override"
	SAY NAME1 "Mage Robe"
	SAY UNIDENTIFIED_DESC "Since the age of Netheril, mages have learned to bestow a wide variety of magical properties upon the everyday objects that surround them. A favorite item of such enchantment is the common robe. It is lightweight, affordable, and holds its enchantment well, thereby making it ideal equipment for a mage. Due to their magical heritage, however, only single-, dual-, and multi-class mages may wear these enchanted robes.

STATISTICS:

Weight: 3"

	SAY NAME2 "Mage Robe of Cold Resistance"
	SAY DESC "These are a common sight in the Sword Coast region, especially as one travels north toward Neverwinter and the Icewind Dales. Many young mages receive it as a gift from their instructors upon successfully completing their first five years of study. As with other such robes, they can only be worn by those of the wizardly profession.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
- Armor Class: 9
– Cold Resistance: +25%

Weight: 3"




