STATISTICS:

Weight: 3"

	SAY NAME2 "Robe of Elemental Absorption"
	SAY DESC "Crafted by the eccentric Dragon Coast mage, Evard of Westgate, this silken vestment was designed to endure the chaotic elemental clashes of local spell-duels. Infused with crushed residue of minor mephit hearts, the cloth acts as a grounding sponge for raw natural energies, dulling the bite of sudden sparks, freezing gales, and searing flames alike. While it lacks the reality-bending power of archmage regalia, it provides a reliable, steady ward for any traveling scholar navigating the hazardous roads of the Heartlands.

STATISTICS:

Equipped abilities:
- Armor Class: 8
– Fire Resistance: +25%
– Cold Resistance: +25%
– Electrical Resistance: +25%
- Saving Throws: +1

Weight: 4"







